ent":"Первый платёж — сразу после подтверждения, далее в ту же дату каждого периода. За 24 часа до списания приходит напоминание.","lineHeight":1.5,"fontFamily":"$font-body","fontSize":13.5,"fontWeight":"500"}]},{"type":"frame","id":"sRArX","name":"Q Как отменить подписку?","width":"fill_container","fill":"$bg","cornerRadius":"$r-lg","layout":"vertical","gap":8,"padding":18,"children":[{"type":"frame","id":"HybCJ","name":"Question","width":"fill_container","gap":12,"alignItems":"center","children":[{"type":"text","id":"dyo4c","name":"Text","fill":"$ink","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"Как отменить подписку?","fontFamily":"$font-head","fontSize":16,"fontWeight":"700"},{"type":"icon","id":"blPnL","name":"Chevron","width":17,"height":17,"icon":"chevron-down","library":"lucide","weight":500,"fill":"$ink-3"}]},{"type":"text","id":"c8KNnu","name":"Answer","fill":"$ink-2","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"«Профиль → Подписка → Отменить». Доступ сохраняется до конца оплаченного периода, деньги за него не списываются повторно.","lineHeight":1.5,"fontFamily":"$font-body","fontSize":13.5,"fontWeight":"500"}]},{"type":"frame","id":"YFNPn","name":"Q Есть ли возврат?","width":"fill_container","fill":"$bg","cornerRadius":"$r-lg","layout":"vertical","gap":8,"padding":18,"children":[{"type":"frame","id":"BMwTt","name":"Question","width":"fill_container","gap":12,"alignItems":"center","children":[{"type":"text","id":"Av5Qb","name":"Text","fill":"$ink","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"Есть ли возврат?","fontFamily":"$font-head","fontSize":16,"fontWeight":"700"},{"type":"icon","id":"EY0mA","name":"Chevron","width":17,"height":17,"icon":"chevron-down","library":"lucide","weight":500,"fill":"$ink-3"}]},{"type":"text","id":"XtDQL","name":"Answer","fill":"$ink-2","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"Да, в течение 14 дней с момента списания, если возможности тарифа не использо